==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology 1===
From Italian [[alicorno]]. Etymology unclear. Odell Shepard explains it as a Romance word "licorno" ("the horn") prefixed by the Arabic definite article "[[ال|al-]]".

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

